    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a natural extension of my analytical mind—something I’ve always found intuitive rather than intimidating. It’s not just about numbers; it’s the language that helps me solve problems in physics and even creative projects like photography, where precision matters. Though I’m not deeply formalized in it, I enjoy breaking down concepts to understand them better.",
